Package: alder
Title: Reactive Notebook for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carl", "Stone", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "carl@alder.dev")
Description: A modern reactive notebook environment for R. Plain-text .R
    notebook files are statically analyzed into a dependency DAG and executed
    in dependency order, with a marimo-inspired UX. Running a cell reruns its
    dependencies and descendants automatically (with an optional lazy mode);
    widgets are ordinary notebook values read through explicit $value; apps
    are output-only views. R-specific limitations (reference-object and
    external side effects, worker process isolation rather than a sandbox)
    are explicit.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
